<!-- ── INVESTIGATION ── -->
<section id="investigation">
  <div class="investigate-pattern"></div>
  <div class="section-header fade-up">
    <span class="section-number t-label">01</span>
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-title">What it<br>investigates</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">The School works where artistic research meets science, technology and the body.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="investigate-grid">
    <div class="investigate-field fade-up">
      <span class="t-label investigate-index">01</span>
      <h3 class="investigate-title">Strange questions</h3>
      <p class="location-feature-desc">The work starts from questions that do not fit a product brief or a standard lab protocol. What happens if a room becomes an instrument, a garden listens, a gesture becomes a drawing.</p>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Artistic Research</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="investigate-field fade-up">
      <span class="t-label investigate-index">02</span>
      <h3 class="investigate-title">Science and technology as material</h3>
      <p class="location-feature-desc">Sensors, code, circuits, models and scientific methods are handled like any other material: tested, stressed, combined, allowed to fail. The point is not to master a tool. The point is to see what the material does.</p>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Speculative AI</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="investigate-field fade-up">
      <span class="t-label investigate-index">03</span>
      <h3 class="investigate-title">Embodied systems</h3>
      <p class="location-feature-desc">Bodies, biosignals, machine perception, biological systems and spatial interaction are the field. Inquiry happens through movement, touch, voice, signal and presence — not only through screens.</p>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Embodied Systems</span>
        <span class="tag">Biosignals</span>
        <span class="tag">Machine Perception</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="investigate-field fade-up">
      <span class="t-label investigate-index">04</span>
      <h3 class="investigate-title">Possible futures</h3>
      <p class="location-feature-desc">The School treats the future as something that can be prototyped and encountered, not predicted. Small experiments allow a future condition to be tested before it becomes a scenario.</p>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Artistic Research</span>
        <span class="tag">Speculative AI</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
